#NEXUS

[ shi2015_pone_fig4: Nymphalid tree, panel A, 36 tips. The root is drawn as a trichotomy ((Coreana, Protantigius), Spindasis takanonis, Nymphalidae). Subfamily names after the tips (–Biblidinae and the like) are labels, not part of the tip names; 'Melanitis Leda' is kept as printed. Outside-corpus case: chosen to test whether the tool generalises beyond dinosaur figures, not drawn at random. Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node; topology only. ]

